# Generated from the OSRS Wiki page "Transcript:Shilo Village" by tools/quests/transcript_to_dialogue.py
0	section	Starting out
0	section	Talking to Mosol Rei
1	box	Mosol seems to be looking around very cautiously. He jumps a little when you approach and talk to him.
1	line	Mosol Rei	Run! Run for your life! Save yourself! I'll keep them back as long as I can...
1	option	Why do I need to run?
2	line	Player	Why do I need to run?
2	line	Mosol Rei	Your very life is in danger. Rashiliyia has returned and we are all doomed.
2	option	Rashiliyia? Who is she?
3	line	Player	Rashiliyia? Who is she?
3	line	Mosol Rei	Rashiliyia is the Queen of the dead. She has returned and has brought a plague of undead with her. They now occupy our village and we have them trapped. I warn people like yourself to stay away.
3	option	What can we do?
4	line	Player	What can we do?
4	line	Mosol Rei	We're doing all we can to keep the undead at bay. The village is covered in a deadly green mist. If you go into the village, a terrible sickness will befall you.
4	line	Mosol Rei	And the undead are even stronger beyond the gates. My guess is that it has something to do with the Legend of Rashiliyia.
4	line	Mosol Rei	But you would need to talk to the Shaman in Tai Bwo Wannai village to get more details about that. I really have to go now and fight these undead.
4	option	Why are the undead here?
5	line	Player	Why are the undead here?
5	line	Mosol Rei	Rashiliyia! The Queen of the undead has risen! She is the mother of the undead creatures that roam this land. But alas I know nothing of the legend that surrounds her.
5	option	Legend you say?
6	line	Player	Legend you say?
6	line	Mosol Rei	Yes.... I said it is a legend that I know nothing about.
6	option	Oh, ok, sorry for bothering you.
7	line	Player	Oh, Ok, sorry for bothering you.
7	line	Mosol Rei	Ok, perhaps you'd like to be on your way now?
7	action	end
6	option	Oh come on, you must know something.
7	line	Player	Oh come on, you must know something?
7	box	Mosol lowers his head in deep concentration.
7	line	Mosol Rei	Well, let me think now...
7	box	He scratches his head...
7	line	Mosol Rei	Hmmm, there was something I think that might help...
7	box	Mosol strains to remember something...
7	line	Mosol Rei	Nope, sorry. It's gone.
7	option	Maybe you know someone who does know something?
8	line	Player	Maybe you know someone who does know something?
8	line	Mosol Rei	My guess is that this has something to do with the legend of Rashiliyia. But you need to speak to the Shaman in 'Tai Bwo Wannai' village to get more details about that.
8	line	Mosol Rei	I really have to fight these undead now Bwana, before they take over the world!
8	option	Oh, ok, sorry for bothering you.
9	action	above
8	option	I'll go to see the Shaman.
9	line	Player	I'll go to see the Shaman.
9	line	Mosol Rei	Well, that would be helpful Bwana. If you're sure you want to go, you can take a Wampum belt to him for me. It will give the Shaman, Trufitus the story of our problems down here. Are you sure you want to go?
9	option	Errr, I'm having second thoughts now.
10	line	Player	Errr, I'm having second thoughts now.
10	line	Mosol Rei	That's Ok Bwana, it's a big responsibility. Come back and see me if you change your mind.
10	action	end
9	option	Yes, I'm sure and I'll take the Wampum belt to Trufitus.
10	line	Player	Yes, I'm sure and I'll take the Wampum belt to Trufitus.
10	line	Mosol Rei	I would be very grateful if you did. Here take this...
10	box	Mosol gives you a Wampum belt.
10	action	Player receives the Wampum belt, or it drops to the floor if the player has no inventory space.
10	line	Mosol Rei	Please can you give it to Trufitus. He may be able to give you extra details on the legend surrounding Rashiliyia. Good luck!
10	action	end
9	option	Ok. Thanks for your help.
10	line	Player	Ok. Thanks for your help.
10	line	Mosol Rei	You're welcome Bwana, good luck.
10	action	end
