0	section	Using the Wampum belt on Trufitus
1	box	You show Trufitus the Wampum belt, he studies it for a long time.
1	line	Trufitus	Hello Bwana, this message from Mosol Rei bears bad news... Yes, things do look very bad indeed.
1	option	What do you know about Rashiliyia?
2	line	Player	What do you know about Rashiliyia?
2	line	Trufitus	Hmmm, it's been a long time since I heard that name. Rashiliyia is the Queen of the Undead. And a more fearsome enemy you will be unlikely to find.
2	line	Trufitus	I fear that you bring me news that she has returned to plague us once again? Alas I know of no weakness that she has.
2	option	So there is nothing we can do?
3	line	Player	So there is nothing we can do?
3	line	Trufitus	Not that I can think of.
3	option	Oh, ok!
4	line	Player	Oh, ok!
4	line	Trufitus	Yes, it's a bit sad really, I liked that village.
4	box	Trufitus seems deeply touched...
4	line	Trufitus	Well, I hope you will excuse me, but I need to get back to my studies.
4	action	end
3	option	Should I start to evacuate the Island?
4	line	Player	Should I start to evacuate the island?
4	line	Trufitus	Yes, that may be a good idea. Many people could die! If only there was a way to defeat her!
4	option	Mosol Rei said something about a legend?
5	line	Player	Mosol Rei said something about a legend?
5	line	Trufitus	Ah, yes, there is a legend, but it is lost in the midst of antiquity...
5	line	Trufitus	The last place to hold any details regarding this mystery was in the temple of Ah Za Rhoon....and that has long since vanished... it crumbled into dust...
5	option	Why was it called Ah Za Rhoon?
6	line	Player	Why was it called Ah Za Rhoon?
6	line	Trufitus	It is from an ancient language. The direct translation is... 'Magnificence floating on water'. But my research makes me believe that the temple was built on land.
6	line	Trufitus	And most likely between large bodies of water, for example large lakes. However, many people have searched for the temple, and have failed. I would hate to see you waste your time on a pointless search like that.
6	option	Thanks for the information!
7	line	Player	Thanks for the information!
7	line	Trufitus	What information?
7	line	Player	About Ah Za Rhoon and where it is.
7	box	Trufitus looks at you blankly...
7	line	Trufitus	Hmmm, well, you are welcome bwana.
7	option	Do you know anything more about the temple?
8	line	Player	Do you know anything more about the temple?
8	line	Trufitus	Not much... I would say that is about it...
8	line	Trufitus	Even the great priest Zadimus who built the temple did not survive. Some say that Rashiliyia caused the temple to collapse.
8	line	Trufitus	She was angry at Zadimus for not returning her affections. She was a great sorceress even before they met.
8	option	Tell me more.
9	line	Player	Tell me more.
9	line	Trufitus	I don't know anymore. You're very demanding aren't you!
9	option	Thanks for the information!
10	action	above
9	option	Do you know anything more about the temple?
10	action	above
9	option	I am going to search for Ah Za Rhoon!
10	line	Player	I am going to search for Ah Za Rhoon!
10	line	Trufitus	What?! You must be crazy! That place has passed into myth and legend, it has been buried under rubble for years. It's most likely buried 20 men deep, and that's if you can actually find it.
10	line	Trufitus	Are you sure you're going to go and look for it? I may be able to do some research into this if you agree. Only I don't want to waste my time if you're not serious about this!
10	cond	If the player does not have all the requirements and has a combat level below 45:
11	box	Before starting this quest, be aware that one or more of your skill levels are lower than what is required to fully complete it. Your combat level is also lower than the recommended level of 45.
10	select	Start the Shilo Village quest?
10	option	Yes.
11	line	Player	Yes, I will seriously look for Ah Za Rhoon and I'd appreciate your help.
11	line	Trufitus	Ok then Bwana, good luck with your quest, and remember to stock up well with adventuring supplies before setting off. You never know how useful some fairly ordinary things might be when you're
11	line	Trufitus	adventuring.
11	line	Trufitus	I'll hold on to this Wampum belt for you for the time being. I'll give it back to you when we have completed this quest.
11	action	end
10	option	No.
11	line	Player	Actually, now it comes to it, I'm having second thoughts.
11	line	Trufitus	Well, I understand. Perhaps you can search for it another time? Come back when you think you're ready. Excuse me now won't you while I return to my studies.
11	action	end
9	option	It's a pity that I can't search for Ah Za Rhoon now.
