5	option	Do you know anything more about the temple?
6	action	above
4	option	Will you pack your things now?
5	line	Player	Will you pack your things now?
5	line	Trufitus	I will wait and see what will happen. Maybe Rashiliyia does not have the power to strike too far from her resting place? But there are many things that I need to do now.
5	option	Is her resting place important?
6	line	Player	Is her resting place important?
6	line	Trufitus	I believe it is! It might be that her physical remains are the focal point of her supernatural powers. It is said that many years ago, a group of adventurers once infiltrated her tomb to try to rid the world of Rashiliyia.
6	line	Trufitus	These adventurers reported seeing a wraith- like creature.
6	line	Trufitus	Although the adventurers disturbed Rashiliyia's bones, they were not able to properly sanctify them. And this is the most likely reason why she still plagues us today.
6	line	Trufitus	Of course, she only has to order one of her minions to move her bones and she can quite quickly and easily set up a new headquarters anywhere and continue to launch her plague of undead.
6	option	What are minions?
7	line	Player	What are minions?
7	line	Trufitus	Minions are the fiendish undead creatures that she controls. She has very few living worshippers, but they need to be dealt with at some point.
7	option	Thanks for the information!
8	action	above
7	option	Does she have any weaknesses?
8	line	Player	Does she have any weaknesses?
8	line	Trufitus	I am not sure, but the legend about her certainly is long. It's a pity that the temple of Ah Za Rhoon has crumbled as there may be some clues that could help us to defeat her.
8	line	Trufitus	I think the largest problem will be in locating her resting place.
8	option	Why was it called Ah Za Rhoon?
9	action	above
8	option	Is her resting place important?
9	action	above
