7	line	Player	Yes of course, I mean Minions, what made you think I said Onions?
7	box	Trufitus frowns at you but continues about...minions...
7	line	Trufitus	Minions are the fiendish undead creatures that Rashiliyia controls. She has very few living worshippers, but they need to be dealt with at some point.
7	line	Trufitus	Usually a strong creature of some sort will be guarding the bones and it is not to be tackled lightly.
