0	section	Talking to Trufitus again
1	line	Trufitus	Hello Bwana, how goes your quest to find Ah Za Rhoon?
1	option	Well thanks...
2	line	Player	Well thanks...
2	line	Trufitus	Well that's very good news. Let me know if you find anything useful, I may be able to help out.
2	action	end
1	option	Erm, I don't know where to look?
2	line	Player	Erm, I don't know where to look?
2	line	Trufitus	Hmm, that doesn't surprise me. The only information I have refers to its name. Ah Za Rhoon, its name means 'Magnificence Floating on Water'.
2	option	Do you think it was floating on water?
3	line	Player	Do you think it was floating on water?
3	line	Trufitus	It's very doubtful. I suspect it was built to 'appear' as if it was floating on water. Perhaps on an island or between large bodies of water.
3	line	Trufitus	If you search for somewhere like this, you may find something worth investigating.
3	action	end
2	option	Ok thanks for your help.
3	line	Player	Ok thanks for your help.
3	line	Trufitus	You're welcome Bwana, I only hope it helped.
3	action	end
