2	line	Rashiliyia	Which non-kin dares enter my tomb?
2	line	Rashiliyia	My minions will finish thee!
2	box	You feel invisible hands starting to choke you...
2	line	Player	* Gaaaa.... *
2	action	Rahiliyia spawns 1-3 undead ones
2	action	end
1	cond	If the player is wearing the Beads of the Dead:
2	box	The Beads of the Dead start to glow...
2	action	end
