0	section	Activate the Locating crystal
1	box	You feel the crystal trying to draw upon your spiritual energy. Do you want to let it?
1	select	Select an Option
1	option	Yes, just this once.
2	cond	If the player is too far from the Tomb of Rashiliyia:
3	box	There is nothing different about the crystal. You're most likely not close enough for it to be active.
3	action	end
2	cond	If the player is within 200 squares of the Tomb of Rashiliyia:
3	box	The crystal glows faintly.
3	action	end
2	cond	If the player is within [unknown squares] of the Tomb of Rashiliyia:
3	box	The crystal glows brightly.
3	action	end
2	cond	If the player is within [unknown squares] of the Tomb of Rashiliyia:
3	box	The crystal is very bright.
3	action	end
2	cond	If the player is within [unknown squares] of the Tomb of Rashiliyia:
3	box	The crystal blazes brilliantly.
3	action	end
1	option	Yes, always let it draw from my spiritual energy.
2	action	Same as above, and further activations don't provide the options.
1	option	No, it sounds a bit dangerous.
2	box	You decide not to allow the crystal to draw on your spiritual energy.
2	action	end
0	section	Talking to Trufitus after visiting the Tomb of Rashiliyia
1	line	Player	Hello.
1	line	Trufitus	Greetings again Bwana. I hope that you have managed to locate Rashiliyia's Tomb. Again, if you found anything interesting, please show it to me.
1	option	What should I do now?
2	line	Player	What should I do now?
2	box	Trufitus scratches his head.
2	line	Trufitus	Well Bwana, if you have Rashiliyia's remains, you need to find a way to put her spirit to rest. Perhaps there was a clue with one of the artefacts that you have?
2	line	Trufitus	Why not have a look through the artefacts that you have found and see if there is some clue that might help? If you do not have her remains, you will need to find them.
2	action	end
1	option	Thanks!
2	line	Player	Thanks!
2	line	Trufitus	You're more than welcome Bwana! Good luck for the rest of your quest.
2	action	end
0	section	Using Rashiliyias' remains on Trufitus
