1	line	Trufitus	This is truly incredible bwana... So these are the remains of the dread Queen Rashiliyia?
1	line	Player	Yes, I think so.
1	option	What should I do with them?
2	line	Player	What should I do with them?
2	line	Trufitus	Hmm, I'm not exactly sure... Perhaps there is a clue in one of the artefacts you have found?
2	option	Can you take them off my hands?
3	line	Player	Can you take them off my hands?
3	line	Trufitus	I dare not take them, I may be taken over by the evil spirit of Rashiliyia!
3	option	What should I do with them?
4	action	above
